# Verify map

How `/verify`, `/test` and `/ship` check each surface. Delete each example row once you add real ones.

## Changed path → how it is verified

| Changed path | How to verify | Evidence to capture |
|---|---|---|
| `server/routes/invoices/**` | Run the dev server, call the route with a real session | Example only: response body + log line |

## Dry-run entry points

| Entry point | Dry-run flag | What it prints |
|---|---|---|
| `scripts/send-reminders` | `--dry-run` | Example only: the reminders it would send |

## Irreversible side effects (never run as a test)

| Action | Why | Safe alternative |
|---|---|---|
| Charging a card | Example only: real money moves | Use the provider's test mode |

## Protected fixtures and seeds

| Fixture or seed command | Rule |
|---|---|
| `npm run seed:demo` | Example only: safe to re-run; never edit the protected demo account |

## Test accounts

Env var names only, never values or passwords.

| Env var | Holds |
|---|---|
| `TEST_USER_EMAIL` | Example only: login for the standard test user |
